        <head>GWILIM</head>
        <p>GWILIM</p>
        <p>EVAN&amp;</p>
        <p>BITTERS.</p>
        <p>QUININE</p>
        <p>BIITERS.</p>
        <p>QUININE BITTERS MANUFACTURING CO.</p>
        <p>(LnuTED). LLANELLY, SOUTH WALES. American Depot—Ma. R. D. WILLIAMS, Pharmacist, Plymouth, Penna.</p>
