d, 85 (Miss I' M Reynolds, Bank House School, Warring ton); Pass : Sybil H J C Jones, 80 (MMlle Rod, Bank House School, Warrington, Mr e Reynolds) ; Alice Crompton, 79 (Mr J J Lythgoe, L.L.C.M., Egypt-street, Warrington) ; Thomas Gibson, 77 (Widnes Academy of Music, Mr JSF Ainsley); Bertha Smith, 75 (Mrs Briggs, Duke-street, St. Helens) ; Annie Williams, 72 (Mr J J Lythgoe, L.L.C.M., Warrington) ; Mary Evans, 63 (Misses Westbrook, Beech House School, Stockton Heath, Warrington) ; Ethel Richardson, 66 (Mr. J J Lythgoe, L.L.C.M., Warrington).</p>
